# ◈ packages.list — core set
#
# One category/atom per line. USE flags in brackets are optional and are
# passed straight to emerge as a per-atom USE override for the build only —
# they are not written into the live package.use of the build container.
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# Format:
#   category/package[-version]  [use:flag1,-flag2,flag3]
#
# This file is the CORE set — small, fast-building tools. Graphics stack
# lives in packages.graphics.list, the Calamares installer stack in
# packages.calamares.list. All three are built in parallel by
# build-packages.yml's matrix, each with its own 6-hour job ceiling.
#
# Examples (replace with your real curated set):

sys-apps/portage
sys-kernel/dracut
sys-fs/lvm2
net-misc/openssh
app-shells/bash
app-editors/neovim                use:lua,-python
dev-vcs/git
sys-process/htop
net-misc/curl
app-arch/tar
sys-apps/util-linux
